        "@value": "Seksyen 86 Akta ibu dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_30__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (1), dengan memotong perkataan “Penalti: Sepuluh ribu ringgit. Penalti ingkar.”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_30__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (1) subseksyen yang berikut: “(1 a) Jika berlaku keingkaran pada mematuhi subseksyen (1), syarikat Labuan dan tiap-tiap pegawai syarikat itu yang ingkar melakukan suatu kesalahan di bawah Akta ini. Penalti: Lima puluh ribu ringgit. Penalti ingkar.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_30__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_30",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (4), dengan menggantikan perkataan “Sepuluh” dengan perkataan “Lima puluh”. Pindaan seksyen 87"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "31",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2022/5/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__para_c",
